# 1. Stockists (Pharmacy Discovery)

## Searchable

- Business name
- Trade name
- City / area
- GST (if publicly searchable by policy)
- Drug license (if publicly searchable by policy)

## Filterable

- City/region
- Connection status (Not Connected, Requested, Active, Rejected)
- Verified only (default true)
- Serviceable area

## Sortable

- Name A–Z
- Recently active
- Connection status

## Exportable

- Generally no bulk export of discovery directory for pharmacies (unless explicitly allowed)

